Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:39:02 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] build(process): merge-ready skill in the repo,
 deterministic merge planner, collaborator rule

- .claude/skills/merge-ready/SKILL.md: the maintainer's merge-ready procedure on
  `cargo xtask merge-plan`, so every agent and fork runs the same steps.
- merge-plan: every ordering choice is a named total order ending in the PR
  number; the plan prints the base sha and each head sha; `--json`; the
  plan renderer moves to merge_plan_out.rs.
- Any collaborator's review and merge-ready label count and any collaborator
  may merge (maintainer, 2026-11-12); replaces the owner-only rule.
- PROCESS_VERSION 32.

Fixes #1320

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
